          <button class="mode" data-voice="female" type="button"><span class="mode-dot"></span><span><span class="mode-title">Female presenter</span><small>Clear stakeholder walkthrough tone</small></span></button>
        </div>
        <p>Browser voice quality depends on the device and installed voices. For best demos, generate MP3 files and keep them with the working PPT package.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="audio-card reveal">
        <div class="player-top"><div class="player-title" id="playerTitle">Key Win of the Month</div><div class="player-num" id="playerNum">Slide 2 / 8</div></div>
        <div class="wave" id="waveform"></div>
        <div class="progress-row"><span class="time" id="currentTime">0:00</span><div class="track"><div class="fill" id="fill"></div></div><span class="time" id="totalTime">0:18</span></div>
        <div class="controls">
          <button class="ctrl" id="prevBtn" aria-label="Previous slide" type="button">◀</button>
          <button class="ctrl play" id="playBtn" aria-label="Play voice preview" type="button">▶</button>
